# Open AI Video Enhance from the Timeline clip toolbar. Starts: editor with clip $1 (file name prefix, e.g. ve-0600)
# on the main track, clip not selected. Ends: the panel open. The clip toolbar opens at Split…; two 700 px drags
# bring 「Enhance」 into view (the first drag is ignored if sent before the toolbar settles, hence the wait).
lbl [AID]TimeLineVideo_$1
waitfor "Split" --timeout 5
fingerdrag 900 2250 200 2250 8
fingerdrag 900 2250 200 2250 8
lbl Enhance
waitfor "AI Video Enhance" --timeout 5
lbl AI Video Enhance
waitfor "Selected Length" --timeout 10
